{"lyrics":"[00:00.14]\"How did all this trouble begin?\"\n[00:01.92]\"Livin' in America!\"\n[00:04.02]\"Hahaha, nothin' wrong\"\n[00:08.86]\"Nothing wrong at all you're not in any difficulty, but you're out on bond?\"\n[00:11.94]\"No I'm not.\" (Shee, yeah)\n[00:14.72]\"Have all the charges been dropped?\" (Yo, goin' crazy)\n[00:16.56]\"Yeah I'm out of love\" (All my niggas goin' crazy, yeah)\n[00:19.28]\"Haha are you out on love or out of love, which is it?\" (IAmMillzMusic)\n[00:20.88]\"I don't love!\" (Shee, all my niggas goin' crazy, yeah)\n[00:22.14]\"I'm out of love tonight-tonight, you find me\" (All these bitches goin' crazy)\n[00:23.74]\"Now, James, this isn't the first time you and your wife have had a problem, are you two gonna be able to work this out?\"\n[00:28.00](See a nigga with the money, and I'm whippin' water I promise I make 'em go crazy)\n[00:34.50]Came in on the new shit\n[00:35.94]Niggas talking dumb, but they ain't never do shit\n[00:38.06]Ho's on me and they prolly actin' stupid\n[00:41.22]I'll never wife no bitch, that's foolish\n[00:43.38]I don't care about shit but my jeweler\n[00:46.34]Fuck school, I'm the black Ferris Bueller\n[00:48.98]Clip longer than a motherfuckin' ruler\n[00:51.04]Versace on a nigga like I'm fuckin' on Medusa, woah\n[00:54.82]Take a second, think about it, take a second\n[00:58.78]All my niggas eatin' we need seconds\n[01:01.38]I be killin' niggas, that's a preference\n[01:04.00]I be smokin' weed, up in heaven\n[01:06.30]All these niggas Microsoft, Windows 7\n[01:08.44]I'ma be the man 'round here and that's a blessing\n[01:11.18]I been killin' motherfuckers since a fuckin' adolescent\n[01:13.74]Nigga you should feel threatened, god damn\n[01:16.70]I'm the fuckin' man, bitch, I'm dumping off the gym\n[01:19.28]Dunkin' on these niggas I don't even need a rim\n[01:21.96]Run up on yo' spot, killin' him, him and him\n[01:24.52]All my niggas crazy, but my pockets never slim\n[01:26.48]Boy I swear the god, ballin' out like I'm Tim Hardaway, Hardaway\n[01:28.08]Ballin' out like I'm Tim, shee, I just ballin' out like I'm Tim\n[01:30.08]\"I-I-I've been excited for this long\"\n[01:31.08]\"And what are you gonna say to your fans when they ask you some questions about it?\" (IAmMillzMusic)\n[01:44.48]\"I'm gonna say 'I feel good!'\"\n[01:45.28]Hopped on the track like, damn, I'ma get 'em\n[01:47.80]Fry a motherfucker like a motherfuckin' skillet\n[01:50.42]Boy it's JuiceTheKidd on this track, I'ma get it\n[01:52.98]Choppa kinda hungry, bet it eat you up for dinner\n[01:55.68]I'm the fuckin' man and yo' niggas know I'm in it\n[01:57.66]Real as hell, real as hell, I'd never be pretendin'\n[02:00.68]Real as hell, real as hell, yeah\n[02:03.66]Y-S-L, Super Cell\n[02:05.72]Smokin' weed got me frail\n[02:07.40]Damn, I'm up in the sky\n[02:09.42]I can see clouds, I'm so motherfuckin' high\n[02:12.00]Niggas talking dumb, fuck around and he gon' die\n[02:14.22]Run up on 'em with the choppa, leave his momma traumatized\n[02:17.22]Bitch I am the man, who the fuck is you to I? (IAmMillzMusic)\n[02:19.80]Bitch I am the man, I'm too motherfuckin' high\n[02:22.40]Bitch I am the man, I'm so motherfuckin' fried\n[02:25.10]One more inch, and I can prolly touch the sky like, damn\n[02:29.92]Goin' crazy\n[02:31.26]All my niggas goin' crazy, ayy\n[02:33.86]All my niggas goin' crazy, ayy\n[02:36.26]We got that white like Shady, ayy\n[02:38.92]You know my niggas goin' crazy\n[02:41.00]Rock-a-bye, I ain't talkin' 'bout baby\n[02:44.10]\"What are you gonna say to your fans when they ask you some questions about it?\"\n[04:12.56]\"I'm gonna say 'I feel good!'\"\n[04:14.10]\"Papa's got a brand new battery, It's a mad world\"","words":[[0.14,0.2,"\"How"],[0.24,0.36,"did"],[0.46,0.6,"all"],[0.7,0.84,"this"],[0.92,1.2,"trouble"],[1.24,1.6,"begin?\""],[1.92,2.3,"\"Livin'"],[2.42,2.46,"in"],[2.54,3.58,"America!\""],[4.02,7.42,"\"Hahaha,"],[7.46,7.94,"nothin'"],[8.12,8.4,"wrong\""],[8.86,9.14,"\"Nothing"],[9.18,9.42,"wr